CREATED:20260409T010318Z
DESCRIPTION:The DMO's free spring concert\, Out of This World: Planet Hopp
 ing\, features music inspired by the cosmos. The program includes perenni
 al favorites like The Planets and Star Wars along with contemporary works
  including John Adams's shimmering Harmonielehre and Missy Mazzoli's Orbi
 ting Spheres - a piece written in the shape of a solar system. Join us fo
 r this afternoon of music\; we hope you'll leave feeling inspired and ful
 l of wonder\n\nFree admission\, all are welcome with no tickets required\
 n\nArtistry. Wellness. Passion. Community. These values unite the members
  of the Durham Medical Orchestra\, which draws together health-related pr
 ofessionals\, medical and graduate students of the life sciences\, and co
 mmunity members. Under the leadership of The Victor and Ruth Dzau Artisti
 c Director and Conductor Verena Mösenbichler-Bryant\, our performances of
 fer the benefits of music to wide audiences around the Triangle.
